Error [jet.UseWhileWriteActive]: `editor` is already shared in this call, so it can't be changed here too
  --> tests/ui/ownership/generic_method_trait_and_function_value_calls_share_place_access_2.jet:9:18
    |
  9 |     editor.clash(editor)
    |                  ^^^^^^
 Why: While something is being looked at, nobody else may be changing it
 Fix: Drop the extra use of `editor`, or copy first with `editor.copy()`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0204
